{
  "$description": "MorphScreenUI: the look of everything of ours (the site, the dashboard, the admin, the status page; the SDK's answers after the launch, roadmap Z6), in the W3C Design Tokens format (DTCG 2025.10) as spec/theme.tokens.json is. Black throughout, each layer one step up; eight pastels, each with one job; text only white or one of three greys, the colour going on the mark beside it (a dot, an icon, a bar, a ring). `node ui/build.mjs` writes ui/dist/morphscreenui.css from this file and checks it: every text and surface pair, the chart order, and that no stylesheet colours text. The board: https://claude.ai/artifact/24phdTghjCBXaEssKyGC2m.",
